---
title: "createTempRegistration (kintai-v3: Card Registration Initiation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_timeout_guard: start Promise.race with 10s timeout
    q_timeout_guard --> q_normalize: cardId = cardId.replace(/:/, '').toLowerCase()
    q_timeout_guard --> q_timeout: timeout after 10000ms
    q_timeout --> [*]: return {success=false, message='timeout'}
    q_normalize --> q_check_existing: SELECT FROM attendance.users WHERE card_id = normalizedCardId
    q_check_existing --> q_already_registered: existingUser found
    q_already_registered --> [*]: return {success=false, message='card already registered'}
    q_check_existing --> q_db_error: query error (not PGRST116)
    q_db_error --> [*]: return {success=false, message='database error'}
    q_check_existing --> q_cleanup: no existing user (PGRST116)
    q_cleanup --> q_generate_token: DELETE FROM temp_registrations WHERE card_id AND is_used=false
    q_generate_token --> q_insert: token = 'qr_' + randomUUID(), expires_at = now + 30min
    q_insert --> q_insert_success: INSERT INTO temp_registrations(card_id, qr_token, expires_at, is_used=false)
    q_insert_success --> [*]: return {success=true, token}
    q_insert --> q_insert_error: insert error
    q_insert_error --> [*]: return {success=false, message='registration error'}

    note right of q_cleanup
        INV-001: Previous incomplete registrations for same card_id are deleted before new one
        INV-002: QR token format is 'qr_' prefix + UUID v4
        INV-003: Token expires in exactly 30 minutes from creation
    end note

    note right of q_check_existing
        INV-004: Uses admin client (createSupabaseAdminClient) bypassing RLS
        INV-005: PGRST116 error code means 'no rows found' and is treated as success path
    end note
